Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:33.24,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 我们不知道他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, they could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且兰德尔若是跑回来 这里需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Randall come back, we're gonna need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克和肖恩还没回来 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick and Shane ain't back? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们听见了枪声 - 也许他们找到了兰德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We heard a shot. - Maybe they found Randall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到他了 - 把他押回棚屋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We found him. - Is he back in the shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到咬他的行尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the walker that bit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是他没有被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the weird thing is he wasn't bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他脖子断了 - 所以他死前挣扎过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His neck was broke. - So he fought back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是肖恩和兰德尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, Shane and Randall's tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,足迹重合\N{\fnArial\fs30}were right on top of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩不会追踪 所以他不可能跟在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Shane ain't no tracker, so he didn't come up behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你去外面把瑞克和肖恩找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please get back out there, find Rick and Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚到底发生了什么好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find out what on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被咬了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bit too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是肖恩了 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't Shane. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有听到枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I… I heard a gunshot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没在周围看见行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't see any walkers nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:04:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩到底是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did Shane die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God! Go-go-go-go…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we gotta get to the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉其他人 - 我们没法回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- tell the others. - We'll never get through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 跟紧点 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, stay close. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕特里夏 关灯 - 我去拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Patricia, kill the lights. - I'll get the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它们和公路那尸群一样只是路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just passing, like the herd on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是该进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we just go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋子里又没有秘密地下通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless there's a tunnel downstairs I don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:05:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种规模的尸群足以把房子碾平\N{\fnArial\fs30}A herd that size would rip the house down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔不在 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl's gone. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在楼上 但我找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… he was upstairs. I can't find him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许是躲起来了 - 他应该就在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he's hiding. - He's supposed to be upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会抛下我儿子逃走的 - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not leaving without my boy. - We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再找找 一定会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna look again. We're gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,俺们村里长大的都会用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grow up country, you pick up a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这数量 有枪也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the number… It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想走可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把它们全灭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna take 'em all on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有枪 有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have guns. We have cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能杀多少杀多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill as many as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用汽车把剩下的引走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll use the cars to lead the rest of them off the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说真的吗 - 这是我的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - This is my farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我誓死不弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我反正无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. It's as good a night as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 好 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上面去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你呢 - 我一会就上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, what about you? - I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下令你就放火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the lighter when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少阻止一部分行尸接近房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stop some of them from reaching the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,引开剩下的 这样我们还有一线生机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and distract the others, so at least we'll have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.81,0:07:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey-hey-hey, look at me. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go-go-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想大开荤戒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来这儿 过来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, over here. Come on, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开稳点 - 我尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep it steady! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谷仓着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The barn's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸们被引过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是瑞克放的火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Rick set it to draw 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他偷偷溜出去了 - 我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So maybe he snuck outside. - What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是去找瑞克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've run off, maybe looking for Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者他去追兰德尔了 - 可能是他放的火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- or went after Randall himself. - Maybe he set the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是瑞克或者肖恩放的火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've been Rick or Shane who started that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他们正在往外逃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're trying to get out back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到周围看看 快去 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you circle around? Go! - Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.69,0:10:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车开到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在这 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it right there! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们到处都是 没法围住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all over the place. There's no corralling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算子弹用完也没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna run out of ammo before we even make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要新的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a new game plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里 往树林里跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Head for the woods now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}as fast as you can. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查了小屋 哪儿都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked the shed. I can't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下室和阁楼都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the cellar or the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么就不能听一回话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't he listen for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他跟着他爸走 走得就是那条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok okay, if he followed his daddy, he went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你会把行尸引到他那边去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you'll lead 'em right to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.34,0:12:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我儿子 - 你要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my boy! - You're gonna have to trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们找到他 他需要见到他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we find him, he's gonna need his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫上其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 帕特里夏 快点 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, Patricia, come on. We've gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel. Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫谢尔 该走了 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hershel, it's time to go! - Come on! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel! Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go. We gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 - 躲在我后边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta go. - Stay behind me. Stay behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上车 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get in! - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.57,0:13:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找卡萝尔 她往那个方向跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Carol… She ran that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们抓住她了 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got her! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I follow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快转弯 在这快转弯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing it around. Swing it around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往外开 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Head out. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立刻离开农场 - 别那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off the farm now. - Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 农场完了 - 我们不能丢下其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie, it's lost! - The others… we can't leave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the farm now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉呢 你看见洛莉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lori? Did you see Lori?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们没完没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,像瘟疫一样 它们到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a plague. They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉 你看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori! Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.67,0:15:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找妈妈和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find mom and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的农场 - 现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my farm! - Not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 来呀 你们来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Rick! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我时间有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I ain't got all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God. Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们绕回公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's just… Let's just circle back to the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见我爸爸了吗 他逃出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see my dad? Did… did he make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看见了吗 - 我什么都没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see? - I couldn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把贝丝弄丢了 我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Beth… I lost Beth. We've gotta go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:18:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.65,0:19:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里什么也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to go back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Beth…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该和洛莉在一起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I… I think she was with Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们逃出来了吗 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they make it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕特里夏呢 吉米呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia? Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们没逃出来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they didn't make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没人逃出来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if nobody made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们把车开回\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's just circle around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给索菲亚留食物的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the highway where we left supplies for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 尸群是从那个方向来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the herd came from that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 把车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop. Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maggie, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还活着 我们逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're alive. We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我相信他们也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I'm sure they are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.22,0:20:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.39,0:20:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很早之前就应该告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've said it a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's been true for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be all right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 妈妈在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, where's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过她会在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… we gotta go back for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 不 我们为什么要逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl… - No. Why are we running?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it is mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是在一英里外的地方等她来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not be safe a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 安静一点好吗 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. You need to be quiet, all right? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是妈妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 卡尔 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Carl, listen… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该把你儿子送到安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to get your boy to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下来等我女儿和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait here for my girls and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一些地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a few places.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挑一个 之后在那碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet up at one of them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿 哪里是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Where is safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.81,0:22:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要确保你儿子的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep your boy safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会躲在一辆车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hide in one of the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果行尸抓到我 那就是命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a walker gets me, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经失去了我的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子 还可能失去了我的女儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my wife and maybe my daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不确定这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是信奉上帝的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点信念吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't profess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.66,0:22:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己明白上帝的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}to understand God's plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是耶稣曾预言让死者复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Christ promised the resurrection of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.49,0:22:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是现在的情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought he had something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.39,0:22:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我预想的完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little different in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.18,0:22:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we gotta turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去面对那些尸群吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight back to that herd?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,高速公路那里 他们都会去那的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The highway's back there. That's where they'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.90,0:23:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克会回到我们最开始停下的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick will go back to where we first broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦也一样 - 我们正向东开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and Glenn too. - We're headed east,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去海岸 我们一开始就应该直接去那\N{\fnArial\fs30}get to the coast. We should've done that from the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好不容易才逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we've got a shot to get out of here in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.61,0:23:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找到卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许和别人一块逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have escaped with somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 但他们只能靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it, but they're on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道去哪找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to even begin to start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 这是找死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.53,0:23:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那让我下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回开 要不然我们就下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then turn around, or you let us out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该就让你们走 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should do it, you know. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your damn minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 过来 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come come come come.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道咱们还能在这待多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much longer we can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有等到妈妈我是不会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm not leaving without mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're just gonna walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子和你女儿们也许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not knowing if my wife, your girls are still out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we live with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在最需要关心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only got one concern now…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保他活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷也许不按规矩出牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature may be throwing us a curveball,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.79,0:24:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但保护孩子依然是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that law is still true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.61,0:24:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.97,0:25:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.66,0:25:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.64,0:25:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.73,0:25:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.53,0:26:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在哪找到大家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you find everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人的车在路上胡乱变道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those guys' tail lights zigzagging all over the road…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.91,0:26:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亚洲人才会开得这么臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}figured he had to be Asian, driving like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.49,0:26:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.23,0:26:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the rest of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.57,0:26:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃到这里的只有我们这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the only ones who made it so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.85,0:26:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.87,0:26:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.23,0:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了我 然后我就没见到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved me, then I lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看见她被扑倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw her go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕德里夏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.14,0:26:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也把她夺走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.51,0:26:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我面前 我当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took her right in front of me. I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉着她不放 爸爸 可她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was holdin' onto her, daddy. She just…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.95,0:26:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那吉米呢 你们看见吉米了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Jimmy? Did you see Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.85,0:26:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在房车里 行尸攻了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the RV. It got overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.39,0:27:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定看见安德莉亚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You definitely saw Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.19,0:27:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were walkers everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见她了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.37,0:27:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要回去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna go back. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.60,0:27:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能扔下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.52,0:27:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道她在不在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if she's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.67,0:27:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在那儿 不在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She isn't there. She isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.57,0:27:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定跑了 或者死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's somewhere else or she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们连找都不找吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're not even gonna look for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.25,0:27:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been walkers crawling all over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.35,0:27:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该往东走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say head east.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.11,0:27:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离大路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay off the main roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.49,0:27:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是大路 越多行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bigger the road, the more walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.05,0:27:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,越多这种畜生 看我宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}more assholes like this one. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.37,0:28:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.25,0:29:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.17,0:29:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,油表警示灯已经亮了一小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been riding red for the past hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.29,0:29:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好告诉他们一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better make sure we don't get forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.87,0:29:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没油了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,油箱早见底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running on fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.33,0:29:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一台车挤不下这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't all fit in one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.74,0:29:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明早去弄点油回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then make a run for some gas in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:30:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要在这儿过夜吗 - 我好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spend the night here? - I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会生篝火 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll build a fire, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.54,0:30:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去找点柴火 别走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go out looking for firewood, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.30,0:30:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这么多箭了 你还有子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only got so many arrows. How you doing on ammo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.35,0:30:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.05,0:30:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能傻鸡巴坐着 暴露自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just sit here with our asses hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话文明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.61,0:30:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家别慌 听瑞克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone stop panicking and listen to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.52,0:30:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们设好防线岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll set up a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.16,0:30:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一早去找点汽油和补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning, we'll find gas and some supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep pushing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和格伦现在就可以跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn and I can go make a run now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.58,0:30:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去找点汽油 - 不行 我们要待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- try and scrounge up some gas. - No, we stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.00,0:30:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没车我们会寸步难行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and people get stranded without a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们现在就寸步难行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we're stranded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.50,0:30:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在情况很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it looks bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.90,0:30:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们经历了风风雨雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've all been through hell and worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但至少大家没走散\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来不确定能重聚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't sure… I really wasn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.31,0:30:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们做到了 我们还在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we did. We're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到庇护所的 肯定能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find shelter somewhere. There's gotta be a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.30,0:30:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, look around. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.67,0:30:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是行尸 他们好像在迁徙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's walkers everywhere. They're migrating or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.31,0:30:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有个地方 不仅能让我们躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a place not just where we hole up,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.79,0:31:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且能防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that we fortify,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.01,0:31:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,能坚守 能把大家重整旗鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunker down, pull ourselves together,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}build a life for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.98,0:31:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一定有这么个地方 我们要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's out there. We just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.88,0:31:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们找到了个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we do find a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.33,0:31:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我们觉得它是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we think it's safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能撑多久却永远说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can never be sure. For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.61,0:31:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想农场发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what happened with the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.19,0:31:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很傻很天真地以为那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fooled ourselves into thinking that that was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.47,0:31:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会再犯那个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't make that mistake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚露营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make camp tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边 休整一天后继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}over there, get on the road at the break of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这可行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this feel right to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.51,0:31:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一行尸来了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if walkers come through,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.68,0:31:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来一伙像兰德尔的人怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}or another group like Randall's?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.29,0:31:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我找到了兰德尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I found Randall, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.05,0:31:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变异了 但他没被咬过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had turned, but he wasn't bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.26,0:31:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会这样 - 瑞克 到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that possible? - Rick, what the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.29,0:31:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩杀了兰德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane killed Randall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直就想这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he always wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.76,0:31:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后尸群抓住了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the herd got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.71,0:32:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.97,0:32:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 在疾控中心时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - At the CDC,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.56,0:32:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.31,0:32:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是携带者\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.51,0:32:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却一句都没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never said anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.17,0:32:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了又能怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it have made a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.17,0:32:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.58,0:32:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不知道是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I have known for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那个家伙有多疯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw how crazy that mo…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.20,0:32:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么不说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.62,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我发现谷仓里的行尸时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, when I found out about the walkers in the barn,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.26,0:32:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了大家好 告诉了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told, for the good of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.83,0:32:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得大家最好别知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought it best that people didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.56,0:33:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有自己的苦衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you had your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.09,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么我能… - 我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there anything that… - I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.85,0:34:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.96,0:34:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了兰德尔 把我引进树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Randall to get me into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他计划好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He planned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.99,0:34:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had… I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.21,0:34:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了他回头的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him every chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.03,0:34:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却把我越领越远\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he kept leading me further out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我任由他带着我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pushed me, and I let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.32,0:34:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after awhile, I knew…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.48,0:34:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉了他的企图和目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew what he was doing, what he was up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.36,0:34:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却还是跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.90,0:34:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有停步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.49,0:34:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以停下 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想一切快点结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.41,0:35:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是不停地找茬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogging me every step of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.50,0:35:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现得好像是我偷了你和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acting like I stole you and Carl, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我是他的绊脚石\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I was in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.91,0:35:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想快点结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.54,0:35:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.61,0:35:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.06,0:35:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了僵尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.76,0:35:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才知道詹纳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I knew Jenner…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.33,0:35:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹纳的话是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenner was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔干掉了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.24,0:38:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟他一起不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not safe with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.68,0:38:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种事竟然瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping something like that from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.18,0:38:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么跟着他 他只会拖你后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need him? He's just gonna pull you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我对瑞克没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Rick's done all right by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.37,0:38:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是他的马仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his henchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.76,0:38:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我则是负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.61,0:38:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该屈居此位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.43,0:38:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个高尚的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.31,0:38:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克很高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick has honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.51,0:38:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该出去搏一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should take our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.80,0:38:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.17,0:38:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有食物 没有燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no food, no fuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.86,0:38:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}no ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.66,0:38:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么声音 - 什么都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - Could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是浣熊或者负鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be a raccoon, could be a possum.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.94,0:39:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.80,0:39:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须上路 还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave. I mean what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪里 - 声音来自那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way? - It came from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.49,0:39:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来的方向 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back from where we came. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最忌讳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we need is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.41,0:39:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,大半夜乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everyone to be running off in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.54,0:39:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have the vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.51,0:39:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不该徒步出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's traveling on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.95,0:39:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惊慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.35,0:39:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想待在这里等着尸群袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sitting here, waiting for another herd to blow through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.54,0:39:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须现在就离开 - 任何人都不准走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to move, now. - No one is going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.63,0:39:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做点什么 - 我正在做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do something. - I am doing something!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.97,0:39:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在凝聚这个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm keeping this group together,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.41,0:39:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been doing that all along, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.05,0:39:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为我愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.29,0:39:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你们杀了我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed my best friend for you people, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.16,0:39:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道他什么德性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what he was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.57,0:39:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he pushed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.92,0:40:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他危及我们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he compromised us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}how he threatened us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.28,0:40:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他导演了整个兰德尔事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He staged the whole Randall thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想诱杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}led me out to put a bullet in my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.93,0:40:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.71,0:40:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我朋友 但是他想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend, but he came after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.89,0:40:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我双手是干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.73,0:40:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们离了我更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you people are better off without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.41,0:40:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.10,0:40:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为能找到容身之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say there's a place for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.34,0:40:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许这只是白日梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe… maybe it's just another pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.67,0:40:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…我是个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe… maybe I'm fooling myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.85,0:40:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么不去自己找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you… Why don't you go and find out yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得寄明信片给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send me a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.01,0:40:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 门大敞着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, there's the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.67,0:41:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福就在门外 看你们能走多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do better? Let's see how far you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.81,0:41:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人走 好的 但丑话说在前面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No takers? Fine. But get one thing straight…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.75,0:41:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.00,0:41:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别再想要什么民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a democracy anymore.
